{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 160,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello and welcome\nto Real Easy English,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3160,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the podcast\nwhere we have real conversations"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6320,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in easy English to help you learn."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 8600,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm Neil and with me is Georgie."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 11200,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hello. Did you know that you can\nnow watch a video of this podcast?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 15960,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And you can read along with a\ntranscript on our website."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19280,
    "dDurationMs": 2840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Visit bbclearningenglish.com."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 27880,
    "dDurationMs": 1240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Hi, Georgie. How are you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 29120,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I'm very well, thank you,\nNeil. How are you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 31200,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How was your journey into work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33040,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My journey into work\nwas very good today, actually."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36480,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we're actually talking\nabout transport today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 39880,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How was your journey to work?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41920,
    "dDurationMs": 2200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My journey was quite easy\nthis morning,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 44120,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "actually. It isn't always."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46360,
    "dDurationMs": 3440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And, Neil, we actually have\na very similar commute, don't we?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49800,
    "dDurationMs": 6960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I get the Tube to work, which\nin the UK is the underground train."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56760,
    "dDurationMs": 3560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, I walk to the station\naround 15 to 20 minutes,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60320,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I get the underground train,\none train,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 63680,
    "dDurationMs": 4400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I change and then get\nanother one, and then I walk to work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68080,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What about you?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 69400,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I do that, but before,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 71520,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before your bit,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 73200,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to get a bus as well."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 75600,
    "dDurationMs": 3520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Are you that far away\nfrom the station?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79120,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A couple of miles."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 80840,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81680,
    "dDurationMs": 1280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Three kilometres."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82960,
    "dDurationMs": 1400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A bit too far to walk, then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84360,
    "dDurationMs": 1160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A bit too far to walk."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85520,
    "dDurationMs": 4440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have walked when the\npublic transport has been unreliable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89960,
    "dDurationMs": 5520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But normally I...\nI get the bus to the Tube stop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 95480,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then I get on the Tube\ninto work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 98880,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Lovely. And do you like the Tube?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100760,
    "dDurationMs": 2120,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you think about it?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102880,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think the Tube is\nvery convenient, actually,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106960,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the trains go\nvery frequently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110320,
    "dDurationMs": 6040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if you miss one, you can wait just a\ncouple of minutes and get the next one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 116360,
    "dDurationMs": 5480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And it's probably the quickest\nway to get into central London"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 121840,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because there's so much traffic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124080,
    "dDurationMs": 2480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Driving is a really bad idea."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 126560,
    "dDurationMs": 3080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I agree with you."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129640,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It is very reliable."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131200,
    "dDurationMs": 1840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's usually very easy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 133040,
    "dDurationMs": 5280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The thing I don't like about it,\nespecially in the morning at rush hour,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 138320,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the number of people on the Tube."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 141560,
    "dDurationMs": 4520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The... the underground trains\nin London are very old."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 146080,
    "dDurationMs": 1760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're very small."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147840,
    "dDurationMs": 3680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they are very\ncrowded in the mornings."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151520,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So 'crowded' means\nthere's lots of people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154400,
    "dDurationMs": 2880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We can also say 'packed'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 157280,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, and I really don't like\nbeing in a tight space"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161040,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with lots of people in the mornings,\nso early in the morning."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165280,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah, I agree, but I'm lucky because\nI get on the Tube at the first stop,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170040,
    "dDurationMs": 2080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so I always get a seat,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172120,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but then by the time you get on,\nit is usually really packed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 177120,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And the closer you get into central\nLondon, the more packed it is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181800,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You're squashed up against strangers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184200,
    "dDurationMs": 1320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not always fun."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185520,
    "dDurationMs": 1600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I hate it.\nWhat about buses?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187120,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Do you like buses?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189920,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Buses are OK."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 191720,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They, in London again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193960,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they are quite frequent"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 196480,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that's convenient."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198160,
    "dDurationMs": 3160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Not always.\nI mean, they are – they're frequent,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201320,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but they're more unreliable\nthan trains, aren't they?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 204640,
    "dDurationMs": 3400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There always seems to be roadworks\nnear where I live,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 208040,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when there are roadworks,\nthere are traffic lights and"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 211360,
    "dDurationMs": 2600,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "then there are delays on the buses."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 213960,
    "dDurationMs": 5040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, in the city,\npublic transport can be great."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 219000,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But what about when we go outside\nof the city?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 222880,
    "dDurationMs": 5200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What do you use to go\nto other parts of the UK?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 228080,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If it's quite far,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229760,
    "dDurationMs": 4800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so if I'm going really far north,\nmaybe to Scotland or to,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 234560,
    "dDurationMs": 3320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't know,\nManchester or a northern city,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237880,
    "dDurationMs": 4000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's probably better to get the train\nbecause it's faster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241880,
    "dDurationMs": 2240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I really like trains.\nYou can relax."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244120,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a relaxing experience."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 246440,
    "dDurationMs": 5960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some of my best travel experiences\nhave been on long-distance trains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252400,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 253240,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 254080,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can you... Where have you been"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255520,
    "dDurationMs": 2040,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's been so fantastic on a train?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 257560,
    "dDurationMs": 4680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Well, I once went from Prague\nto Moscow on a train."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262240,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 262920,
    "dDurationMs": 680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 263600,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What was that like?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 265040,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Really exciting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266960,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Why?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267880,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It took about three days,\nand I was with some friends,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 272880,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and we could eat and drink\nand look out the window."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 275680,
    "dDurationMs": 2720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The landscape changed frequently."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 278400,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was just exciting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284800,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Let's recap the vocabulary we heard\nin this podcast,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 288440,
    "dDurationMs": 4880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "starting with some useful adjectives\nto describe public transport."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293320,
    "dDurationMs": 3760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For example, we had 'crowded',\nwhich means very busy."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 297080,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We also hear 'packed'."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 299040,
    "dDurationMs": 4080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We had 'reliable', which describes\nsomething you can trust,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 303120,
    "dDurationMs": 3880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and 'unreliable', which describes\nsomething you can't trust."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307000,
    "dDurationMs": 5400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We heard 'frequent', which describes\nsomething that happens often."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 312400,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And we also heard 'delayed',"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 314360,
    "dDurationMs": 4760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which means something, like public\ntransport, comes later than expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 319120,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's it for this episode\nof Real Easy English."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321920,
    "dDurationMs": 1720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Don't forget to go to our website"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 323640,
    "dDurationMs": 4560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where you can get a free worksheet to\ndownload to test what you've learnt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 328200,
    "dDurationMs": 1893,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's at bbclearningenglish.com."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330093,
    "dDurationMs": 881,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "See you then."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 330974,
    "dDurationMs": 777,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Goodbye."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 331751,
    "dDurationMs": 989,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bye."
    } ]
  } ]
}
